==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|рас-|тра́тить}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|растра́тить}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|растра́тить|pf|impf=растра́чивать}}

# to [[squander]], to [[waste]], to [[fritter away]]
# to [[illegally]] [[spend]] or [[use]] (someone else's money or property)

